
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Eirini.cloud - Technical Training Hub</title>

    <!-- Plausible Analytics -->
    <script async src="https://plausible.io/js/pa-5KdZD7tcDX1jTUbVVC_P-.js"></script>
    <script>
      window.plausible=window.plausible||function(){(plausible.q=plausible.q||[]).push(arguments)};
    </script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f172a;
            --bg-alt: #111827;
            --card-bg: #111827;
            --card-border: #334155;

            --accent: #2dd4bf;
            --accent-soft: #5eead4;
            --accent-muted: #99f6e4;

            --text-main: #e5e7eb;
            --text-muted: #cbd5e1;
            --text-strong: #f8fafc;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 55%, #020617 100%);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        header {
            padding: 40px 16px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-strong);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        header p {
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 720px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 16px 60px;
        }

        /* About */
        .about-card {
            background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.95);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 22px 26px;
            margin: 30px auto 40px;
            max-width: 900px;
        }

        .about-title {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            color: var(--accent-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .about-text {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        /* Programme Grid */
        .programmes-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .programme-card {
            background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.95);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: 0.25s ease;
        }

        .programme-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            border-color: var(--accent);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.15);
        }

        .programme-header {
            padding: 20px 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        }

        .programme-title {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--text-strong);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .programme-subtitle {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .programme-body {
            padding: 20px 24px;
        }

        .programme-description {
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .programme-highlights {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }

        .programme-highlights li {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding-left: 18px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .programme-highlights li::before {
            content: "→";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .programme-footer {
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .programme-link {
            padding: 8px 18px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #022c22;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .programme-link:hover {
            background: var(--accent-soft);
            transform: translateX(2px);
        }

        .programme-status {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .footer-buttons a {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0 6px;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            background: #020617;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .footer-buttons a:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--accent-muted);
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            header h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Technical Development Journey</h1>
    <p>
        A focused training hub documenting hands-on progression across cloud infrastructure,
        automation, and AI operations.
    </p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <!-- ABOUT -->
<div class="about-card">
    <div class="about-title">Purpose & Background</div>
    <p class="about-text">
        This site is a central hub for structured technical training programmes, documenting deliberate, hands-on progression across cloud infrastructure, automation, and operations.
    </p>
    <p class="about-text">
        My background spans network operations and people management, with a strong foundation in the platforms and practices that underpin production systems. This site documents a structured return to deep technical work - building and validating hands-on capability across the full modern infrastructure stack.
    </p>
    <p class="about-text">
        The 12-week technical depth programme covers networking, Linux, cloud, automation, and reliability engineering - each week grounded in real deliverables against live infrastructure. Alongside it, a series of focused certification programmes target AWS, Terraform, and Kubernetes.
    </p>
</div>


    <!-- PROGRAMMES -->
<div class="programmes-grid">

    <!-- 12 WEEK PROGRAMME -->
    <div class="programme-card">
        <div class="programme-header">
            <h3 class="programme-title">Eirini 12-Week Technical Depth Programme</h3>
            <p class="programme-subtitle">Cloud, infrastructure & automation foundations</p>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-body">
            <p class="programme-description">
                A structured programme designed to rebuild and deepen hands-on engineering
                capability across networking, Linux, AWS, Terraform, Ansible, containers,
                and observability.
            </p>
            <ul class="programme-highlights">
                <li>AWS architecture & networking</li>
                <li>Infrastructure as Code (Terraform)</li>
                <li>Configuration management (Ansible)</li>
                <li>Containers, CI/CD & observability</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-footer">
            <span class="programme-status">In progress • Resumes Feb 15</span>
            <a href="/app1" class="programme-link">View Programme →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- NVIDIA PROGRAMME -->
    <div class="programme-card">
        <div class="programme-header">
            <h3 class="programme-title">NVIDIA AI Infrastructure & Operations</h3>
            <p class="programme-subtitle">GPU & AI workload operations</p>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-body">
            <p class="programme-description">
                A focused certification programme covering GPU infrastructure,
                container orchestration for AI workloads, and operational patterns
                for running inference and training systems in production.
            </p>
            <ul class="programme-highlights">
                <li>GPU architecture & orchestration</li>
                <li>Kubernetes with GPU workloads</li>
                <li>Inference & production AI operations</li>
                <li>Monitoring & operational readiness</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-footer">
            <span class="programme-status">Exam target: Feb 11</span>
            <a href="/app2" class="programme-link">View Programme →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AWS SAA -->
    <div class="programme-card">
        <div class="programme-header">
            <h3 class="programme-title">AWS Solutions Architect Associate</h3>
            <p class="programme-subtitle">7-Week Certification Programme</p>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-body">
            <p class="programme-description">
                Deep dive into AWS architecture patterns with particular focus on
                edge computing services. Builds on an existing AWS foundation to
                achieve SAA-C03 certification.
            </p>
            <ul class="programme-highlights">
                <li>Edge computing & IoT services</li>
                <li>High availability & disaster recovery design</li>
                <li>Security & compliance architecture patterns</li>
                <li>Container orchestration (ECS/EKS) & serverless</li>
                <li>Hands-on portfolio project with edge devices</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-footer">
            <span class="programme-status">Starting Mar 2026</span>
            <span class="programme-link disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TERRAFORM ASSOCIATE -->
    <div class="programme-card">
        <div class="programme-header">
            <h3 class="programme-title">HashiCorp Terraform Associate</h3>
            <p class="programme-subtitle">3-Week Certification Programme</p>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-body">
            <p class="programme-description">
                Infrastructure-as-Code expertise for modern deployment patterns,
                focusing on declarative infrastructure management and automation
                at scale.
            </p>
            <ul class="programme-highlights">
                <li>Terraform fundamentals & state management</li>
                <li>Reusable modules for infrastructure patterns</li>
                <li>Multi-environment deployment strategies</li>
                <li>Distributed infrastructure automation</li>
                <li>Version-controlled infrastructure workflows</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-footer">
            <span class="programme-status">Starting Apr 2026</span>
            <span class="programme-link disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CKA -->
    <div class="programme-card">
        <div class="programme-header">
            <h3 class="programme-title">Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA)</h3>
            <p class="programme-subtitle">6-Week Certification Programme</p>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-body">
            <p class="programme-description">
                Industry-standard Kubernetes certification consolidating knowledge
                from my Eirini-12 Week-Training Programme K8s foundations, AWS EKS experience, and NVIDIA GPU
                orchestration. Focused on production cluster administration.
            </p>
            <ul class="programme-highlights">
                <li>Cluster architecture & component management</li>
                <li>Workload scheduling & resource optimization</li>
                <li>Storage, networking, and security in production</li>
                <li>Troubleshooting & performance tuning</li>
                <li>Production operations & operational best practices</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="programme-footer">
            <span class="programme-status">Autumn 2026</span>
            <span class="programme-link disabled">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>


